/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 48 0 R
/T (We held a qualitative community focus group with eight South Asian participants aged 14 to 34. Waffa Hameed and Jamal Aziz facilitated the session, drawing on lived experience, youth work and mental-health knowledge.)
/E (We held a qualitative community focus group with eight South Asian participants aged 14 to 34. Waffa Hameed and Jamal Aziz facilitated the session, drawing on lived experience, youth work and mental-health knowledge.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
67 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 48 0 R
/T (Participants gave consent for the discussion to be recorded. Images of different substances, short videos and agree-or-disagree statements were used to introduce the subject and encourage discussion. Participants then responded to questions and to one another, sharing observations, experiences and different points of view.)
/E (Participants gave consent for the discussion to be recorded. Images of different substances, short videos and agree-or-disagree statements were used to introduce the subject and encourage discussion. Participants then responded to questions and to one another, sharing observations, experiences and different points of view.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
