163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (The focus group showed that the young men already possessed considerable awareness of addiction and the pressures surrounding it. They connected substance use with peer influence, anxiety, bereavement, boredom, deprivation and attempts to escape difficult feelings. They did not excuse harmful behaviour, but neither did they reduce addiction to weakness or bad character.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
