/P 55 0 R
/T (The Young Khadims is a youth-led volunteer and community group based in Rochdale, Greater Manchester. The group brings young people together to serve local residents, support community initiatives and strengthen a culture of compassion, responsibility and selfless service.)
/E (The Young Khadims is a youth-led volunteer and community group based in Rochdale, Greater Manchester. The group brings young people together to serve local residents, support community initiatives and strengthen a culture of compassion, responsibility and selfless service.)
/Pg 17 0 R
